---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import CtaSection from '../components/CtaSection.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About"
  eyebrow="About"
  heading="Named tech, named signals, and 15+ years in the market."
  sub="gtmWizards is the done-for-you team of hubsell, run by the people behind hubsell and Kadanco. Our team does the outbound, you take the meetings. Nothing in the stack is rented, and nothing is a black box."
  description="gtmWizards is hubsell's done-for-you outbound service: signal-led outbound for traditional industries, run by senior European sales operators, delivering booked meetings."
>
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Why we started gtmWizards</h2>
      <p>
        After 15+ years building outbound technology and running campaigns
        across Europe, we kept seeing the same two failure modes: tools that
        demand time and expertise most teams don't have, and agencies that
        rent their tooling and hide where their data comes from.
      </p>
      <p>
        gtmWizards is our answer to both. It is hubsell's done-for-you
        service: our team runs your outbound end to end on
        <a href={SITE.hubsellUrl}>hubsell</a>, the platform we build and run,
        from signals we can point to rather than lists we bought. You don't
        learn a tool or hire a team. You get booked meetings.
      </p>
      <h2>What we believe</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Proof over claims.</strong> Our technology is a public
          product you can demo, not a slide in a pitch deck.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Seniors do the work.</strong> Campaigns are planned and
          run by experienced operators. We never sell seniority and deliver
          juniors.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Language is one of the edges, not the whole pitch.</strong> English by default, German
          natively where it matters, because traditional European industries reply to people
          who sound like they belong.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Judge us on meetings.</strong> Not on emails sent, dials
          made or dashboards delivered. A pilot first, and we only keep going
          if the meetings earn it.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaSection
    heading="Talk to the people who will actually run your campaigns"
    sub="No SDR farm, no account-manager relay. A strategy call here is with a founder or senior operator."
  />
</PageLayout>
